<div class="brochure-section container-fluid">

    <!-- LOCATION -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">LOCATION :</h3>
        <p>
            The <strong>GYAN SAGAR PUBLIC SCHOOL</strong> is located at Agarwa, Motihari,
            East Champaran, Bihar. The school is housed in an excellent building
            with huge campus, well ventilated spacious classrooms and other required amenities.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- SCHEME OF STUDIES -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">SCHEME OF STUDIES :</h3>
        <p>
            The school runs classes from Pre-Nursery to Xth. The syllabus for all
            classes is through Central Board of Secondary Education and the course
            and books shall be those of N.C.E.R.T.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- MORNING ASSEMBLY -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">THE MORNING ASSEMBLY :</h3>
        <p>
            Regular features include prayer, pledge, news reading, speech, thought for the day,
            recitation and English spoken quiz etc. It helps pupils overcome stage fear
            and develop confidence clearly and creatively.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- REGISTRATION -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">REGISTRATION & ADMISSION :</h3>
        <p>
            Students are registered prior to admission. Registration form is available
            in the prospectus. Students and guardians must appear at the admission test.
            Admission of selected students begins after two days of the test.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FEE STRUCTURE -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">SCHOOL FEE STRUCTURE</h3>

        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="brochure-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Registration Charge</td>
                    <td>Rs. 1000.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Admission Charge</td>
                    <td>Rs. 1500.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Annual Charge</td>
                    <td>Rs. 1000.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Misc Charge (Tie, Belt, Diary)</td>
                    <td>Rs. 300.00</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MONTHLY FEE -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">MONTHLY TUITION FEE</h3>

        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="brochure-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Nursery to UKG</td>
                    <td>Rs. 800.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Std. I to IV</td>
                    <td>Rs. 900.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Std. VI to Xth</td>
                    <td>Rs. 1200.00</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <p class="small-note">
            Tuition fee is payable between 1st to 10th of every month.
            Fine of Rs.50 will be charged after due date.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- UNIFORM SECTION -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">SCHOOL UNIFORM</h3>

        <div class="uniform-grid">

            <div>
                <h5>Boys (Play to V)</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>White Shirt</li>
                    <li>Blue Pant</li>
                    <li>Blue Sweater</li>
                    <li>Black Shoes</li>
                    <li>Blue Socks</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h5>Boys (VI to X)</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>Striped Brown Shirt</li>
                    <li>Dark Brown Pant</li>
                    <li>Dark Brown Sweater</li>
                    <li>Brown Shoes</li>
                    <li>Brown Socks</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h5>Girls (Play to V)</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>White Shirt</li>
                    <li>Blue Skirt</li>
                    <li>Blue Sweater</li>
                    <li>Black Shoes</li>
                    <li>Blue Socks</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h5>Girls (VI to X)</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>Striped Brown Kurti</li>
                    <li>Dark Brown Salwar</li>
                    <li>Dark Brown Sweater</li>
                    <li>Brown Shoes</li>
                    <li>Brown Socks</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- EXTRA FEATURES -->
    <div class="brochure-block">
        <h3 class="brochure-heading">EXTRA FEATURES</h3>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <ul>
                <li>1st Term – April to September</li>
                <li>First Periodic Test – May</li>
                <li>Second Periodic Test – July</li>
                <li>Half Yearly – September</li>
            </ul>

            <ul>
                <li>2nd Term – October to February</li>
                <li>IIIrd Periodic Test – November</li>
                <li>IVth Periodic Test – January</li>
                <li>Annual Exam – March</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SIGNATURE -->
    <div class="signature-section">
        <div>
            <strong>Director</strong><br />
            Md. Anwar Hussain
        </div>
        <div>
            <strong>Principal</strong><br />
            Dr. Dharmendra Kr. Mishra
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
